        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flappy Coq – The 2D Rooster Simulator Game</strong> is a fast-paced, funny, and fiendishly difficult arcade challenge with real stakes. Flap your way to the top of the global leaderboard — because this isn’t just about bragging rights. It’s a tournament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s more than a flappy clone — it’s a meme-fueled, rage-inducing, prize-chasing comedy wrapped in bright 2D visuals. Whether you’re aiming for the leaderboard or just trying to survive another pipe, <i>Flappy Coq</i> will keep you coming back for “just one more run.”</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐓 <strong>Simple Controls, Brutal Challenge</strong> – One action button. Infinite ways to fail.<br>Keyboard controls are FAR better for scoring more hens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Global Tournament Mode</strong> – High scores are synced across all platforms, with yearly prize pools and real winners.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>Precision Gameplay</strong> – Every flap matters; every mistake is your fault.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😂 <strong>Dark Humor &amp; Crude Comedy</strong> – Yes, the rooster roots hens. Yes, it’s ridiculous.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Cross-Platform Leaderboards</strong> – Compete with players everywhere, anytime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Cartoon 2D Visuals</strong> – Bright, colorful, and absurd.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Controller &amp; Keyboard Support</strong> – Play how you like, from couch to desk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 <strong>Score Attack Mode</strong> – The only goal is survival, domination, and prizes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flap. Fail. Laugh. Compete. Win.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flappy Coq – The 2D Rooster Simulator Game</strong> is a fast-paced, funny, and fiendishly difficult arcade challenge with real stakes. Flap your way to the top of the global leaderboard — because this isn’t just about bragging rights. It’s a tournament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s more than a flappy clone — it’s a meme-fueled, rage-inducing, prize-chasing comedy wrapped in bright 2D visuals. Whether you’re aiming for the leaderboard or just trying to survive another pipe, <i>Flappy Coq</i> will keep you coming back for “just one more run.”</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐓 <strong>Simple Controls, Brutal Challenge</strong> – One action button. Infinite ways to fail.<br>Keyboard controls are FAR better for scoring more hens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Global Tournament Mode</strong> – High scores are synced across all platforms, with yearly prize pools and real winners.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>Precision Gameplay</strong> – Every flap matters; every mistake is your fault.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😂 <strong>Dark Humor &amp; Crude Comedy</strong> – Yes, the rooster roots hens. Yes, it’s ridiculous.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Cross-Platform Leaderboards</strong> – Compete with players everywhere, anytime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Cartoon 2D Visuals</strong> – Bright, colorful, and absurd.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Controller &amp; Keyboard Support</strong> – Play how you like, from couch to desk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 <strong>Score Attack Mode</strong> – The only goal is survival, domination, and prizes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flap. Fail. Laugh. Compete. Win.</p>",
